&_nc_oc=AdrqC7vxEbo9ava5BlA0xWeW98PznCFUUlRLQGmP0WdZQWQWZ8Ifz1rN1FgP-Pt36LA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR9DhtUAXcyIq4jviiESNQ49rB1syhEh0WLrrYSkeZVxQ&oe=6AE8A93E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p42r0zyYZZMQ7kNvwG_id1A&_nc_oc=AdpYL_Crsd_tkdjTkhBrbZthx4JZAhU22AfQ8OkLCdCkz8FJQCFvp7vDjQOYt0I0YI0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQbZo9_RsUCzpPU0AxXGGvTNA5Bx3Ig0rB2xUGisr2Qcw&oe=6AE8BA3C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0_q6k8N3kK8Q7kNvwH-rxUv&_nc_oc=AdqLFHUV9Ct1tqtHbyueUTVGZ1mXLverlybkckWllPUXHAwp8g94H4uVd_EsOII58Xs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS1v_45HRN2ELU2tArwOjgIY10rt0Jq-m0lVakN9C0-hg&oe=6AE8A087"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bDiN8jSUQIYQ7kNvwGnW-fX&_nc_oc=AdqC3_GmO---i6H9vuDFi2oyWl2nCi7AVpIX3h9orclzFi3ecwcrwmhS5TvU__vZerQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQNFdeJiLJUI8R0rrYDlmVoTufFNjHZxCbf6BRL57Ctvw&oe=6AE8C495"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8tgjZdSjui4Q7kNvwHsgxR6&_nc_oc=Adr-PaOKS94MmQs02j006PfCw79q4K6TQiv-yCFgddNlviBv0gvroIGDIaJ4pyY8Hcs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSsowbakhpkbIw6FXs-3VW8WuTJOnoMuiIGeAXxSZH4Cg&oe=6AE898E4"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.